        "heading_QT3NtK": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Magic of \"Plug & Go\"",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_HbUzHe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’ve all been there: arriving at a hotel room or a coffee shop, only to realize you’ve forgotten your <strong>ac adapter</strong> or the right charging cable. At RORRY, we designed the <strong>RORRY Flow</strong> series to solve this exact problem. By choosing a plug in power bank, you’re choosing an all-in-one solution. Our <strong>power bank with outlet</strong> functionality means you can plug the device directly into any portable wall socket to recharge both the bank and your phone simultaneously. No more hunting for blocks in the bottom of your bag—just pure, streamlined efficiency.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
