        "text_PUkkD4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For the modern woman, a <strong>portable plug in charger</strong> should be as discreet and stylish as a piece of jewelry. Our portable power with outlet collection features high-capacity cells wrapped in a compact, portable plug design with foldable prongs. It’s the best plug in power bank for those who value space in their carry-on. Whether it’s a <strong>usb c charging block</strong> for your iPad or a portable battery charger with outlet for your Apple Watch, RORRY ensures you stay connected from the airport lounge to the boardroom.</p>",
