        "text_Hmkn4a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our <a href=\"/collections/power-banks\" title=\"Power Banks\"><strong>portable charger</strong></a> with wall plug isn’t just about the AC input; it’s about what it can do for your devices. Featuring <strong>built in cables and wall plugs</strong>, RORRY devices are the smallest power banks with ac outlet that don’t compromise on speed. They act as a portable power plug when connected to the wall and a high-speed battery when you’re on the move. Join the community of travelers who have switched to a <strong>power bank with built in ac wall plug</strong> and experience the freedom of cable-free power.</p>",
